Third-party code in this repository
===================================

SRC/  —  WCH CH32V003 Standard Peripheral Library
-------------------------------------------------

Everything under SRC/ (Core, Debug, Ld, Peripheral, Startup) is WCH's vendor
library, redistributed unmodified from the official CH32V003 EVT package. It is
not covered by this repository's MIT licence. Each file carries its own header:

    Copyright (c) 2021 Nanjing Qinheng Microelectronics Co., Ltd.
    Attention: This software (modified or not) and binary are used for
    microcontroller manufactured by Nanjing Qinheng Microelectronics.

That is the whole of WCH's stated licence. Read literally, it permits use with
WCH microcontrollers and says nothing about redistribution either way. In
practice WCH distributes the EVT package publicly and freely, and a large number
of public projects vendor it the same way this one does.

It is bundled here so the examples build with no setup, which is the point of
the repository. If you would rather not redistribute it, delete SRC/ and
download the EVT package from WCH instead:

    https://www.wch-ic.com/products/CH32V003.html
    https://github.com/openwch/ch32v003

The driver in lib/ depends only on the SPL's public API (ch32v00x.h and the
GPIO/RCC/I2C headers) plus Delay_Init/Delay_Us/Delay_Ms from SRC/Debug. It has
no dependency on anything in SRC/ being present in this tree specifically, so it
drops into any CH32V003 project that already has the EVT library.

Every copyright header in SRC/ has been left intact. Please keep it that way.


HD44780 / ST7066U
-----------------

No vendor code is involved — the driver is written from the published Hitachi
HD44780U and Sitronix ST7066U datasheets. Those documents are referenced in the
README but not redistributed here.
